Package: RIBITSr
Title: R Interface to the RIBITS API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Alexander", "Dhond", , "alexander.k.dhond@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R interface to interact with the Regulatory In-lieu fee and Bank Information Tracking System (RIBITS) API.
    This package facilitates the download and analysis of mitigation banking data directly within R.
